            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.104</h2><ul><li>Removes Powerhouse resource pressure as a readiness blocker; resource posture is now diagnostics-only.</li><li>Runs Powerhouse warmup aggressively without selected-only fallback deferral or worker throttling.</li><li>Honors Cerebras as the selected Companion Realtime Voice LLM when native iPhone STT/TTS are selected.</li><li>Prevents Cerebras-selected turns from silently falling back to the local/Qwen planner when the Cerebras planner response is incomplete.</li><li>Raises runtime request body ceilings for large audio/config payloads.</li></ul>
]]></description>
